  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space into the ultimate football sanctuary with this custom sports comforter set from Jeminise. Featuring a bold, dark photorealistic illustration of an American football player holding a football close up, this bedding is the perfect gift for football players, fans, and coaches alike. Add a personal touch with customizable name and number options to make your bedroom truly one of a kind.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your bedding with your own name (up to 25 characters) and jersey number (up to 5 characters) for a personalized team look.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Comfy &amp; Durable Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with soft, lightweight microfiber filling designed to prevent clumping and shifting.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Vibrant &amp; Fade-Resistant:</strong> Advanced printing techniques ensure rich, lasting dye retention with neat, fine stitching along the edges for enhanced durability.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Flexible Options:</strong> Available as either a lightweight duvet cover with a hidden zipper closure or a cozy, all-in-one filled comforter.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Optional Accessories:</strong> Customize your set further by adding matching football-themed pillowcases or an additional flat sheet cover.</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water on a gentle cycle; tumble dry low or air dry for quick, fluffy results.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dark Football Art</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football / Sports</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name and Number inputs</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n    <tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash cold, tumble dry low</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
